{"id":"1f5f1eda24b49673","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-measure7-tight-family-of-measures.md","title":"ZFC Measure7 Tight Family Of Measures","display":"df-zfc-measure7-tight-family-of-measures — ZFC Measure7 Tight Family Of Measures","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure7-tight-family-of-measures","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure7-tight-family-of-measures"],"display":"df-zfc-measure7-tight-family-of-measures — ZFC Measure7 Tight Family Of Measures","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-measure7-borel-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure7-tight-family-of-measures"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure7-tight-family-of-measures</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure7-tight-family-of-measures — ZFC Measure7 Tight Family Of Measures"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc62425f71562bf8\" href=\"?note=fc62425f71562bf8\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-measure7-borel-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-measure7-borel-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\mathcal M \\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\mathcal M \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7BorelSigmaAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7BorelSigmaAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}K\">\\(\\tau\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}K\\)</span> is the subspace topology defined below</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7TightFamilyOfMeasures}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7TightFamilyOfMeasures}_S\\)</span> is the three-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}subspace\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\\tau\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}K\\coloneqq\\{K\\cap U:U\\in\\tau\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}subspace\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\\tau\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}K\\coloneqq\\{K\\cap U:U\\in\\tau\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}tight\\text{-}family\\text{-}of\\text{-}measures}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7TightFamilyOfMeasures}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal M)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7BorelSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mu\\in\\mathcal M\\;(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal B)\\land\\mu(X)=1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R\\;(\\varepsilon&gt;0\\to\\exists K\\subseteq X\\;(K\\in\\mathcal B\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\tau\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}K)\\land\\forall\\mu\\in\\mathcal M\\;(\\mu(X\\setminus K)&lt;\\varepsilon)))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}tight\\text{-}family\\text{-}of\\text{-}measures}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7TightFamilyOfMeasures}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal M)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7BorelSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mu\\in\\mathcal M\\;(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal B)\\land\\mu(X)=1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R\\;(\\varepsilon&gt;0\\to\\exists K\\subseteq X\\;(K\\in\\mathcal B\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\tau\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}K)\\land\\forall\\mu\\in\\mathcal M\\;(\\mu(X\\setminus K)&lt;\\varepsilon)))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>紧性在同一紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 上对整族概率测度一致成立；这比逐个测度各自选择紧集更强。</li>\n<li>显式固定共同的 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数，并要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 可测，因而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(X\\setminus K)\">\\(\\mu(X\\setminus K)\\)</span> 总有定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-measure7-borel-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"fc62425f71562bf8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-measure7-borel-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,\\mathcal M \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7BorelSigmaAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7TightFamilyOfMeasures}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}subspace\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\\tau\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}K\\coloneqq\\{K\\cap U:U\\in\\tau\\}","display":true},{"t